1、创建image_topic
mkdir -p ~/catkin_ws/src
1️⃣ 进入你的工作空间
假设你的 ROS 工作空间是 ~/catkin_ws，如果还没有，可以先创建：
mkdir -p ~/catkin_ws/src
cd ~/catkin_ws
catkin_make
source devel/setup.bash

- src 目录用于存放所有 ROS 包
- catkin_make 会编译工作空间
- source devel/setup.bash 配置环境变量
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2️⃣ 创建新包
在 src 下使用 catkin_create_pkg 命令：
cd ~/catkin_ws/src
//catkin_create_pkg <package_name> <dependencies>
catkin_create_pkg image_talker roscpp std_msgs sensor_msgs cv_bridge
示例：
如果你想创建一个名为 image_talker 的包，需要依赖 roscpp、std_msgs、sensor_msgs、cv_bridge：
catkin_create_pkg image_talker roscpp std_msgs sensor_msgs cv_bridge

这条命令会生成一个基本包目录结构：
image_talker/
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── package.xml
└── src/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3️⃣ 查看和修改 CMakeLists.txt
catkin_create_pkg 会生成一个默认的 CMakeLists.txt，你需要根据你的需求修改：
- 添加 OpenCV 查找
- 添加可执行文件
例如：
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.0.2)
project(image_talker)

find_package(catkin REQUIRED COMPONENTS
  roscpp
  std_msgs
  sensor_msgs
  cv_bridge
)

find_package(OpenCV REQUIRED)

catkin_package()

include_directories(
  ${catkin_INCLUDE_DIRS}
  ${OpenCV_INCLUDE_DIRS}
)

add_executable(image_talker_node src/image_talker.cpp)
target_link_libraries(image_talker_node
  ${catkin_LIBRARIES}
  ${OpenCV_LIBRARIES}
)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4️⃣ 修改 package.xml
确认依赖项正确：
<package format="2">
  <name>image_talker</name>
  <version>0.0.1</version>
  <description>Publish images using ROS</description>

  <maintainer email="your@email.com">You</maintainer>
  <license>MIT</license>

  <buildtool_depend>catkin</buildtool_depend>

  <depend>roscpp</depend>
  <depend>std_msgs</depend>
  <depend>sensor_msgs</depend>
  <depend>cv_bridge</depend>
</package>

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5️⃣ 添加源码文件
在 src 目录下创建 image_talker.cpp（参考我前面给你的 talker_image.cpp 示例）。
目录结构如下：
~/catkin_ws/src/image_talker/
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── package.xml
└── src/
    └── image_talker.cpp

image_talker.cpp
#include <ros/ros.h>
#include <image_transport/image_transport.h>
#include <cv_bridge/cv_bridge.h>
#include <sensor_msgs/Image.h>
#include <opencv2/opencv.hpp>

int main(int argc, char** argv)
{
    ros::init(argc, argv, "image_talker");
    ros::NodeHandle nh;

    image_transport::ImageTransport it(nh);
    image_transport::Publisher pub = it.advertise("camera/image", 1);

    // 读取本地图片
    std::string image_path = "/home/chenkejing/images/test.jpg"; // 替换成你本地图片路径
    cv::Mat frame = cv::imread(image_path);
    if (frame.empty()) {
        ROS_ERROR("Cannot read image at %s", image_path.c_str());
        return -1;
    }

    ros::Rate loop_rate(10); // 10 FPS
    while (ros::ok()) {
        // 转为 ROS Image 消息
        sensor_msgs::ImagePtr msg = cv_bridge::CvImage(std_msgs::Header(), "bgr8", frame).toImageMsg();

        pub.publish(msg);
        ROS_INFO("Published image");

        ros::spinOnce();
        loop_rate.sleep();
    }

    return 0;
}


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6️⃣ 编译包
回到工作空间根目录：
cd ~/catkin_ws
catkin_make

编译完成后，执行：
source devel/setup.bash

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7️⃣ 运行节点
rosrun image_talker image_talker_node

订阅测试：
rosrun image_view image_view image:=/camera/image


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2、创建image_listener (监听节点)
这里给你写一个对应的 ROS 图像监听节点（listener），用于接收你前面 image_talker 发送的 /camera/image 话题，并显示图像。
假设文件名为 src/image_listener.cpp：
#include <ros/ros.h>
#include <image_transport/image_transport.h>
#include <cv_bridge/cv_bridge.h>
#include <sensor_msgs/Image.h>
#include <opencv2/opencv.hpp>

// 回调函数，每收到一帧图像就调用
void imageCallback(const sensor_msgs::ImageConstPtr& msg)
{
    try
    {
        // 将 ROS 图像消息转为 OpenCV 图像
        cv::Mat frame = cv_bridge::toCvShare(msg, "bgr8")->image;

        // 显示图像
        cv::imshow("Received Image", frame);
        cv::waitKey(1); // 必须调用才能刷新窗口
    }
    catch (cv_bridge::Exception& e)
    {
        ROS_ERROR("cv_bridge exception: %s", e.what());
    }
}

int main(int argc, char** argv)
{
    ros::init(argc, argv, "image_listener"); // 节点名称
    ros::NodeHandle nh;

    image_transport::ImageTransport it(nh);
    image_transport::Subscriber sub = it.subscribe("camera/image", 1, imageCallback);

    ROS_INFO("Subscribed to /camera/image topic, waiting for images...");

    ros::spin(); // 循环等待回调
    return 0;
}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CMakeLists.txt 配置
在 CMakeLists.txt 中添加 listener：
add_executable(image_listener src/image_listener.cpp)
target_link_libraries(image_listener ${catkin_LIBRARIES})

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
运行步骤
1.启动 ROS master：
roscore

1.运行图像发布节点：
rosrun image_talker image_talker_node

1.运行图像监听节点：
rosrun image_talker image_listener

1.你会看到 OpenCV 窗口显示图像。
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
💡 提示：
- cv::waitKey(1) 必须调用，否则窗口不会刷新
- 可以调整 loop_rate 控制发送频率
- 适合单张图片循环发送或视频帧流